---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="Current Investments" description="Explore Fran Legacy real estate investments and rental properties in Raleigh, North Carolina.">
  <section class="page-hero investments-hero compact-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-media"></div><div class="page-hero-shade"></div>
    <div class="page-hero-content"><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Our portfolio</p><h1>Properties designed to <em>perform and serve.</em></h1></div>
  </section>

  <section class="portfolio-intro">
    <p class="section-kicker">Current investments</p>
    <div><h2>A portfolio is more than a list of addresses.</h2><p>Each property starts with a thesis: how it can be improved, who it can serve, and where long-term value can be created.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="property-feature">
    <div class="property-image large"><img src="/images/triangle-house.jpg" alt="Raleigh vacation rental home with a pool" loading="eager" /></div>
    <div class="property-copy">
      <p class="mono">Featured property · Raleigh, NC</p>
      <h2>The Triangle gathering house</h2>
      <p class="property-stat">5,962 <span>square feet</span></p>
      <p>A large vacation rental within minutes of RDU and convenient to Raleigh, Durham, and Chapel Hill. Designed for family trips, wedding parties, business groups, and memorable stays with room to gather.</p>
      <ul class="detail-list"><li>Large-group accommodations</li><li>Pool and entertainment amenities</li><li>Central Triangle location</li></ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="property-feature reverse">
    <div class="property-image"><img src="/images/watkinsdale.avif" alt="Rental property at 5121 Watkinsdale Avenue in Raleigh" loading="lazy" /></div>
    <div class="property-copy">
      <p class="mono">Flexible rental · Raleigh, NC</p>
      <h2>5121 Watkinsdale Avenue</h2>
      <p>A comfortable Raleigh home positioned for both short-term stays and long-term co-living. The operating model balances guest convenience with adaptable housing options.</p>
      <ul class="detail-list"><li>Short-term rental</li><li>Long-term co-living potential</li><li>Convenient Raleigh setting</li></ul>
      <a class="button button-dark inline-button" href="https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1282694609128078530" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View on Airbnb <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="portfolio-cta"><p class="section-kicker light">Have a property or opportunity?</p><h2>Let’s see if it belongs in the next chapter.</h2><a class="button button-light" href="/contact">Submit an opportunity <span>↗</span></a></section>
</SiteLayout>
